A||||21||jelly2m8||jelly2m8's great Fiero adventure||||1||
Z||000000||jelly2m8||10-27-2001||09:01 PM|||| I previously posted a tread, Looks to be a long drive ahead. <P> Well, the plans are just about finalized.<BR>I'm flying into Orlando FL On Tuesday the 30th to pick up a 88 T-Top coupe, which I am going to attempt to drive back to Nova Scotia Canada.<P> Looks to be that I am  going to be travelling alone in a car which has been sitting for a year and a half. Apparently this car is drivable with no problems. <BR> <BR> I am going to spend a few days checking it over and putting some miles on it at a friends place in the general area.<BR> If everything is acceptable at that point, I'm going to head out to PA to visit with Skitime and friends. From there it will be to Kickhill Farms in CT. Then home.<P> I have a few contacts from PFF that are willing to lend me a hand along my journey.<BR>Thanks Kempo, Formula88, wantav8, and Skitime. I'll try to at least drop by and say hi in the first week of Nov.<P> I am going to be travelling north up the eastern seaboard. If anyone would be willing to help a fiero friend in case I run into trouble, let me know. I would appreciate it.<P> The general plan is to leave Vero Beach FL on the 1st of Nov. and be at Skitimes place in PA by the 3rd.<P> This may change due to mechanical problems, etc. Hopefully not.<P> Ill post along the way if my plans are changed.<P> Thanks guys<BR>jelly2m8<BR>||||reg||1
