Z||000004||Formula88||10-28-2001||04:14 PM||||Good luck on the trip!  You should be able to make it from Vero Beach to the NC border in about 8 hours, traffic permitting.  I would guess you could make MD in about 8 more.  Not too bad, considering.  <P>BTW, gas prices in SC are cheaper than in NC and GA.  GA gas is cheaper than FL.  And don't forget to bring a spare ignition module!   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><p>[This message has been edited by Formula88 (edited 10-28-2001).]||||reg||14
